# Someone who hasn't joined in yet, five lines in.
~ crowd confused
wtf is happening right now
uh. what did i just log into
is this a raid or a group therapy session
someone explain. slowly.

~ crowd grumble
Are we done? Some of us are hunting.
Children. I'm grouped with children.
I'm not your anything. Leave me out of it.
